      "updated": 1788709220590,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Use Next.js with React and TypeScript.\nUI Framework\n->Tailwind CSS\n->shadcn/ui\n->Lucide Icons\nCharts and Visualization\n->Recharts\n->Apache ECharts or Chart.js\n->Recharts for simple charts\n->ECharts for advanced attack timeline, \n    network graph, and heatmap\n     visualization\nState Management\n->TanStack Query for API data fetching\n->Zustand for lightweight global state\nReal-Time Updates\n->WebSocket or Server-Sent Events\n.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Use Next.js with React and TypeScript.\nUI Framework\n->Tailwind CSS\n->shadcn/ui\n->Lucide Icons\nCharts and Visualization\n->Recharts\n->Apache ECharts or Chart.js\n->Recharts for simple charts\n->ECharts for advanced attack timeline, \n    network graph, and heatmap\n     visualization\nState Management\n->TanStack Query for API data fetching\n->Zustand for lightweight global state\nReal-Time Updates\n->WebSocket or Server-Sent Events\n.",
      "autoResize": true,
