      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788714978712,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "9.1 Main Dashboard Pages\n1. Overview Dashboard\nDisplays:\nTotal events analyzed\nThreats detected\nRisk distribution\nThreat categories\nRecent alerts\nAttack timeline\nTop targeted users\nTop targeted services\nSystem health\n\n4. Impersonation Detection Page\nFeatures:\nAnalyze message\nCompare claimed identity vs communication pattern\nDetect authority impersonation\nDetect brand impersonation\nShow confidence score\n\n\n7. Incident Response Page\nFeatures:\nIncident list\nIncident status\nAssigned analyst\nRecommended actions\nAction history\nEscalation status\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "9.1 Main Dashboard Pages\n1. Overview Dashboard\nDisplays:\nTotal events analyzed\nThreats detected\nRisk distribution\nThreat categories\nRecent alerts\nAttack timeline\nTop targeted users\nTop targeted services\nSystem health\n\n4. Impersonation Detection Page\nFeatures:\nAnalyze message\nCompare claimed identity vs communication pattern\nDetect authority impersonation\nDetect brand impersonation\nShow confidence score\n\n\n7. Incident Response Page\nFeatures:\nIncident list\nIncident status\nAssigned analyst\nRecommended actions\nAction history\nEscalation status\n",
