    },
    {
      "id": "iJVs9dVFh4HiHpStJoeWK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20109.64067266595,
      "y": 52184.8896359037,
      "width": 1654.95654296875,
      "height": 4230,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1405686722,
      "version": 112,
      "versionNonce": 1275209374,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788716216644,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Phase 1: Platform Foundation\nWe build the base architecture.\nCreate frontend React/Next.js project\nCreate backend FastAPI project\nConfigure PostgreSQL\nConfigure Redis\nConfigure MinIO\nCreate authentication system\nCreate dashboard layout\nCreate event submission forms\nCreate basic API endpoints\nExpected result:\nUser can submit data from dashboard and backend can store it.\n\nPhase 2: Phishing and URL Detection\nWe implement the first mandatory scenario.\nTasks:\nEmail analysis endpoint\nMessage analysis endpoint\nURL analysis endpoint\nPhishing feature extraction\nRisk scoring\nLLM explanation\nDashboard phishing page\nExpected result:\nSystem detects phishing email or malicious URL and explains the risk.\n\n\nPhase 3: Impersonation Detection\nWe implement the second human-layer scenario.\nTasks:\nIdentity claim extraction\nAuthority impersonation detection\nBrand impersonation detection\nCommunication style analysis\nOpenRouter-based semantic reasoning\nImpersonation risk score\nExpected result:\nSystem detects fake CEO, fake bank, fake teacher, or fake government official impersonation attempts.\n\n\n\nPhase 4: Deepfake Detection\nWe implement digital impersonation through media.\nTasks:\nImage upload analysis\nAudio upload analysis\nVideo frame extraction\nManipulation probability model\nAuthenticity score\nEvidence visualization\nExplanation generation\nExpected result:\nSystem analyzes uploaded media and gives authenticity score.\n\n\nPhase 5: Account Takeover Detection\nWe implement technical abnormal behavior.\nTasks:\nAuthentication log ingestion\nFailed login detection\nImpossible travel detection\nUnknown device detection\nSession anomaly detection\nRisk scoring\nExpected result:\nSystem detects suspicious login or account takeover attempt.\n\n\nPhase 6: Network and API Threat Detection\nWe implement intelligent cyber threat detection.\nTasks:\nNetwork flow analysis\nAPI log analysis\nData exfiltration detection\nAnomaly detection\nAlert generation\nExpected result:\nSystem detects abnormal network/API behavior.\n\n\nPhase 7: Response Engine and SOC Dashboard\nWe complete the response cycle.\nTasks:\nIncident creation\nRecommended actions\nAction execution simulation\nIncident workflow\nSOC dashboard metrics\nAttack timeline\nReal-time alert updates\nExpected result:\nComplete pipeline:\nDetection → Classification → Risk Assessment → Explanation → Alert → Recommended Response",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Phase 1: Platform Foundation\nWe build the base architecture.\nCreate frontend React/Next.js project\nCreate backend FastAPI project\nConfigure PostgreSQL\nConfigure Redis\nConfigure MinIO\nCreate authentication system\nCreate dashboard layout\nCreate event submission forms\nCreate basic API endpoints\nExpected result:\nUser can submit data from dashboard and backend can store it.\n\nPhase 2: Phishing and URL Detection\nWe implement the first mandatory scenario.\nTasks:\nEmail analysis endpoint\nMessage analysis endpoint\nURL analysis endpoint\nPhishing feature extraction\nRisk scoring\nLLM explanation\nDashboard phishing page\nExpected result:\nSystem detects phishing email or malicious URL and explains the risk.\n\n\nPhase 3: Impersonation Detection\nWe implement the second human-layer scenario.\nTasks:\nIdentity claim extraction\nAuthority impersonation detection\nBrand impersonation detection\nCommunication style analysis\nOpenRouter-based semantic reasoning\nImpersonation risk score\nExpected result:\nSystem detects fake CEO, fake bank, fake teacher, or fake government official impersonation attempts.\n\n\n\nPhase 4: Deepfake Detection\nWe implement digital impersonation through media.\nTasks:\nImage upload analysis\nAudio upload analysis\nVideo frame extraction\nManipulation probability model\nAuthenticity score\nEvidence visualization\nExplanation generation\nExpected result:\nSystem analyzes uploaded media and gives authenticity score.\n\n\nPhase 5: Account Takeover Detection\nWe implement technical abnormal behavior.\nTasks:\nAuthentication log ingestion\nFailed login detection\nImpossible travel detection\nUnknown device detection\nSession anomaly detection\nRisk scoring\nExpected result:\nSystem detects suspicious login or account takeover attempt.\n\n\nPhase 6: Network and API Threat Detection\nWe implement intelligent cyber threat detection.\nTasks:\nNetwork flow analysis\nAPI log analysis\nData exfiltration detection\nAnomaly detection\nAlert generation\nExpected result:\nSystem detects abnormal network/API behavior.\n\n\nPhase 7: Response Engine and SOC Dashboard\nWe complete the response cycle.\nTasks:\nIncident creation\nRecommended actions\nAction execution simulation\nIncident workflow\nSOC dashboard metrics\nAttack timeline\nReal-time alert updates\nExpected result:\nComplete pipeline:\nDetection → Classification → Risk Assessment → Explanation → Alert → Recommended Response",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
